<!-- WHAT WE'LL OFFER -->
<section class="offer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-script">Services Offered</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h2">What Sunbright offers</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Shaped by 20+ years of experience in addiction treatment — built around what actually works.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offer-grid">
      <div class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-top-bar"></div>
        <span class="offer-tag">Primary</span>
        <div class="offer-ico">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Residential Recovery</h3>
        <p>We offer 30, 60, and 90-day inpatient programs — round-the-clock care in a safe, structured setting where healing can take root. Each day blends individual counseling, group therapy, and life-skills training with time to rest, reflect, and reconnect. Residents live on-site in our 16-bed center with freshly prepared meals, a supportive peer community, and family involvement woven throughout — evidence-based treatment delivered with the warmth of a close-knit community.</p>
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);font-style:italic;margin-top:12px;">Medical detox referrals are coordinated through partner facilities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-top-bar"></div>
        <span class="offer-tag">Community Partner</span>
        <div class="offer-ico">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Dual Diagnosis &amp; Mental Health</h3>
        <p>Healing rarely follows a single path. If substance use and mental health challenges are both part of your story — anxiety, depression, trauma — both deserve real attention. Through our partnership with <a href="https://www.phwcare.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;">Parish Health and Wellness</a>, every resident receives a mental health assessment and ongoing telehealth therapy that begins here and stays with them through every stage of recovery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-top-bar"></div>
        <span class="offer-tag">Step-Down Support</span>
        <div class="offer-ico">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 9l3 3m0 0l-3 3m3-3H8m13 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Aftercare Planning</h3>
        <p>Recovery doesn't end when treatment ends. When you're ready to transition out of residential care, we connect you with trusted IOP programs and sober living options in the community — so you don't walk out the door without a plan and a support network already in place.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-top-bar"></div>
        <span class="offer-tag">Community Referral</span>
        <div class="offer-ico">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sober Living</h3>
        <p>Stable housing isn't just a practical need — it's the foundation everything else is built on. Through relationships with vetted sober living homes — including <strong style="color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;">Stability Solutions</strong> in Tehama &amp; Shasta County — Sunbright helps individuals leaving residential care land somewhere safe, structured, and surrounded by people who understand the road ahead.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

