        <h3>Monetary Donations</h3>
        <p>Cash gifts help the most — they let us put support exactly where it's needed right now. Your dollars make a direct difference across every area:</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" style="color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>A month of a resident's recovery</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" style="color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Day-to-day operational costs</li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.5"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" style="color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Licensing &amp; pre-opening expenses</li>
