        <h3>Give Your Time</h3>
        <p>Lead a life-skills class, mentor a resident, help with beautification and outdoor projects, tend the garden, or lend a hand at fundraisers and community events. Whatever you're good at — teaching, cooking, gardening, organizing, or simply showing up — there's a meaningful place for it here. Even a few hours makes a difference.</p>
        <a href="/get-involved" class="don-link">Volunteer <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg></a>
      </div>

      <div class="don-card">
        <div class="don-icon-box">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 14v3a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-3M3 14V8a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v6M3 14h18M7 14v-3a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 011 1v3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Essential Needs</h3>
        <p>Twin mattresses, blankets, pillows, and bedding; dressers and everyday furniture; kitchen gear like pots, pans, dishes, and small appliances; hygiene products, towels, lotions, and cleaning supplies; plus outdoor benches and a table. New or gently used both help — every item donated is one less cost.</p>
        <a href="/get-involved" class="don-link">See all items needed <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg></a>
      </div>
