<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq-sec" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-side">
        <span class="script-sub">Common questions</span>
        <h2>Things people ask about Sunbright.</h2>
        <p>You probably have questions about when we're opening, how to give, who's behind this, and what we're building. We've answered the ones we hear most.</p>
        <div class="faq-side-card">
          <span class="label">Reach out directly</span>
          <p class="ask">"I'd like to talk to someone about getting involved."</p>
          <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:4px;">Call or email — we love talking with people who care about this community.</p>
          <a href="/contact">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
            Send a Message
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item open">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">Is Sunbright a registered nonprofit?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">Yes. The IRS approved Sunbright Recovery Center's 501(c)(3) determination (EIN 42-2737546), effective May 23, 2026. We're recognized as a public charity, and donations are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law. <a href="/images/irs-501c3-determination-letter.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline">View our IRS determination letter</a>.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">When will Sunbright open?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">We're working through the final licensing and funding steps. The building is fully constructed — what remains is state licensing, furnishing, and staffing. Every donation moves that timeline forward. We'll announce an opening date as soon as it's confirmed.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">Can I donate now, before you're open?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">Yes — and your gift is needed now. We're actively fundraising to furnish every room, equip the kitchen, and cover pre-opening operational costs. Giving now means you're part of why this center opens.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">Where does my donation go?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">Every dollar goes directly toward equipping the center — furnishing bedrooms, outfitting the kitchen, stocking hygiene supplies, and covering the pre-opening costs that get us to day one. Sunbright is community-founded and community-funded. Your gift is what opens these doors.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">What is the facility like?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">Our 16-bed co-ed building is fully constructed at 22425 Sunbright Ave in Red Bluff, CA. The structure is complete — we're currently furnishing each room and preparing for our operating license. You can see photos of the building above.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">Who is founding and running Sunbright?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">Sunbright was founded by Linda Spyres, LCSW, LAADC-CA, who has more than 20 years of experience working in addiction treatment in Northern California. Her vision is a community-rooted, nonprofit recovery center that treats every person with dignity.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" onclick="this.closest('.faq-item').classList.toggle('open')">Will Sunbright be faith-based?<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></button>
          <div class="faq-a">Sunbright is faith-integrated, not faith-required. Spiritual support is available for those who want it — but recovery here doesn't require any particular religious belief. Everyone is welcome, exactly as they are.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

